cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and the software as below."
title: "aztec-whistle-lbm: 3D lattice Boltzmann simulation of an Aztec skull whistle"
type: software
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mmunozarias/aztec-whistle-lbm"
abstract: >-
  Three-dimensional lattice Boltzmann large-eddy simulation of the airflow and sound of a
  3D-printable Aztec skull-whistle replica, with grid-convergence, blowing-pressure and
  sound-quality analyses, job scripts for an HPC cluster, and the figures and results of the
  accompanying paper. The raw simulation output, the simulated sound and the explainer video are archived separately on Zenodo.
keywords:
  - aeroacoustics
  - lattice Boltzmann
  - large-eddy simulation
  - Aztec death whistle
  - Helmholtz resonator
  - roughness
authors:
